  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14269080/assets/3920965948820dd2a71f98b805eac38baf23c59bbad8b24f7b6ab98885a18b31.png)\n\nWhich of the following combinations of transformations map the segment $AB$ to a congruent segment?\n\nI. A vertical stretch with of scale factor $\\frac{3}{2}$ and invariant $x$-axis.\n\nII. A rotation of ${90}^{∘}$ counterclockwise about the point $A.$\n\nIII. A reflection in the $y$-axis.",
