  "html": "<div id=\"question-45300\" class=\"question\" style=\"display: block;\">\n                        <div class=\"questionNumber\">Question 7</div>\n\n                        \n                               \n                         \n        \n\n                        \n                            <div class=\"questionGraphicFrame\"><img id=\"questionGraphic\" src=\"/graphics/q-45300\"></div>\n                        \n\n                        <div id=\"questionText-45300\" class=\"questionText\">\n                            <p>Which of the following combinations of transformations map the segment <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"51\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> to a congruent segment?</p>\n<p></p><ol class=\"questionStatements\"><li>  A vertical stretch with of scale factor <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"52\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and invariant <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"53\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-axis. </li><li>  A rotation of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"54\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.393em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2218\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>90</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>∘</mo></mrow></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> counterclockwise about the point <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"55\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </li><li>  A reflection in the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"56\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-axis. </li></ol>\n<p></p>\n                                     \n                        </div>\n\n                        \n                            <table class=\"choicesTable\">\n                                <tbody><tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceALetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                          \n                                        <div id=\"question-45300-choiceA\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"a\">a</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td class=\"choiceText\">II and III only</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceBLetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                          \n                                        <div id=\"question-45300-choiceB\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"b\">b</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceBText\" class=\"choiceText\">II only</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceCLetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                          \n                                        <div id=\"question-45300-choiceC\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"c\">c</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceCText\" class=\"choiceText\">I and II only</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceDLetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                          \n                                        <div id=\"question-45300-choiceD\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"d\">d</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceDText\" class=\"choiceText\">III only</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceELetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                        \n                                        <div id=\"question-45300-choiceE\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"e\">e</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceEText\" class=\"choiceText\">I, II and III</td>\n                                </tr>\n                            </tbody></table> \n                              \n                    </div>",
